#: ../../source/guides/user/inputs.md:1
msgid "The two inputs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/user/inputs.md:3
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The engine ships with no knowledge of any report and no idea which "
"companies you care about. Both are inputs, both live outside the engine, "
"and it will refuse to guess at either. That refusal is the design, not an"
" omission: see {doc}`../../reference/design/formats-as-plugins`."
msgstr ""

